Package: tf-a-rk3568
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Description: Trusted Firmware-A BL31 for the RK3566 and RK3568
 The EL3 runtime firmware for the Rockchip RK3566 and RK3568, as
 /usr/lib/trusted-firmware-a/rk3568/bl31.elf. It provides PSCI and SCMI.
 The U-Boot image for these boards includes it.
